@startuml seq-05-singer-leaves
' Zangbundel BLE protocol, document v0.10, protocol 1.0 - sections 3.3, 10.9, 10.11
' Scenario 5: a singer leaves the gathering (voluntarily, or by walking out of range).
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tsvg -tpng seq-05-singer-leaves.puml

title BLE 5 – A singer leaves the gathering\nble-protocol.md v0.10, sections 3.3, 10.9, 10.11

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #CFE6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #13315C
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #FF8A3D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFF4EA
skinparam ArrowColor #13315C

actor "Singer (person)" as U
participant "Singer app" as S
participant "Air\n(broadcast)" as AIR
participant "Leader app" as L

alt the singer leaves on purpose  [FR-GATH-07]
  U -> S : songlist sheet → "Kampvuur verlaten" (or system back)  [guiDesign D-34]
  S -> U : confirm: "Je ziet de liedteksten dan niet meer" → Verlaten / Blijven
  U -> S : Verlaten
  S -> S : stop scanning; discard every document received\nin this gathering (song, setlist, message, reqstat)  [FR-DATA-01, FR-DATA-06]
  S -> S : write the gathering memory: name, date, titles sung\n(no names, no device ids)  [FR-DATA-03, guiDesign D-49]
  S -> S : forget tok, sid, xk and the pinned pk
  S -> U : home screen  [guiDesign D-21]
  note over S, L : No message goes to the leader: the protocol has no explicit "leave"\n(ble-protocol 10.9: the leader's count is an upper bound; an explicit leave\nis an open point there). The singer simply stops listening.
else the singer walks out of range (or Bluetooth is switched off)
  AIR --> S : …nothing from the gathering for 10 s…
  S -> S : state RECONNECTING  [3.3]
  S -> U : header strip "opnieuw verbinden…", lyrics stay as they are  [FR-GATH-10, guiDesign D-37]
  alt beacon or frames with the same gid return within the set time (default 5 min)
    AIR --> S : beacon {gid, seq}
    S -> S : compare seq; the carousel delivers whatever was missed\n(normally no connection needed)  [10.9]
    S -> U : header strip "verbonden"
    opt the singer sends a request while reconnected
      S -> L : connect, Join with the known sid → same tok, not counted twice  [9.3]
    end
  else nothing for 5 min  [FR-GATH-11]
    S -> S : state ENDED: treat the gathering as ended  [10.11]
    S -> U : header strip "beëindigd" + banner\n"Het kampvuur is niet meer te vinden"  [guiDesign D-37]
    U -> S : "Terug naar start"
    S -> S : discard documents, write the gathering memory,\ndiscard queued requests with a message  [FR-DATA-01, FR-REQ-03]
  end
end

== Leader side, in both cases ==
L -> L : a singer with no GATT activity for 10 min is removed from the count;\nthe beacon and state show the lower "singers" figure  [10.9, FR-GATH-12]
L -> L : its token stays valid until the gathering ends;\na rejoin with the same sid returns the same token  [9.3]
@enduml
